fields.description:
When checked, JSON such as <pre><code>{
    "a" : [
        {"b" : 2},
        {"c" : 3}
    ]
}</code></pre> gets translated to
<pre><code>&lt;a&gt;
 &lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a&gt;
 &lt;c&gt;3&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
</code></pre> otherwise, it is translated to:
<pre><code>&lt;a&gt;
 &lt;item&gt;
  &lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;
 &lt;/item&gt;
 &lt;item&gt;
  &lt;c&gt;3&lt;/c&gt;
 &lt;/item&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
</code></pre>
